  "id": "performance-appraisal",
  "term": "performance appraisal",
  "definition": "Performance appraisal is the evaluation of an employee’s work performance using stated rules or indicators. In this packet, it refers especially to algorithm-based evaluation, where how clearly the system explains its basis can shape whether workers experience it as understandable guidance or as a loss of professional autonomy.",
